{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bf959539-1453-466e-ba8c-c31aeaad87e9",
    "name": "Cinema-booking Collection",
    "description": "# Cinema Booking API\n\nThis collection covers the full REST API for a cinema booking platform. It is  \norganised into four resource groups that reflect the core domain:\n\n- **Auth** — User registration and login. Use these requests first to obtain a  \n    JWT token, which is stored in the `jwt_token` collection variable and  \n    required by the protected endpoints.\n    \n- **Movies** — Full CRUD for the movie catalogue. Supports listing all movies,  \n    fetching a single movie by ID, adding new titles (with name, description,  \n    duration, and age-limit flag), updating the age-limit of an existing movie,  \n    and deleting a movie.\n    \n- **Sessions** — Manage cinema screening sessions. Supports listing all  \n    sessions, retrieving a session by ID, creating a new session (linked to a  \n    movie, with a date and active status), toggling a session's `isActive` flag  \n    via PATCH, and deleting a session.\n    \n- **Bookings** — Seat reservation workflow. Supports listing all bookings,  \n    retrieving a specific booking by ID, creating a new booking by supplying a  \n    `sessionId` and `seat` number, and cancelling a booking by ID.\n    \n\n## ⚙️ Configuration & Variables\n\n- `{{baseUrl}}` — Managed via the **Postman Environment** file (`Local Docker Env`). It defaults to `http://localhost:7000` (matching the Docker configuration) but can be changed globally in a single field if you run the app on a custom port.\n    \n- `{{jwt_token}}` — A dynamic **Collection Variable** handled automatically. Once you run the `POST /auth/login` request, a post-response script extracts the JWT and injects it here, granting seamless access to all protected endpoints.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "54985562",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/54985562-bf959539-1453-466e-ba8c-c31aeaad87e9?source=collection_link"
  },
